---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who writes this and why.">
  <article class="article">
    <div class="shell">
      <header class="article__head">
        <h1 class="article__title">About</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I build data platforms on Microsoft Fabric — mostly Spark, Delta Lake and the
          engineering practice around them. I speak at FabCon and Data Point Prague.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is where the working notes go: the tuning that fixed a job, the
          concurrency error that took a day to understand, the setting nobody documents.
          Nothing here is advice from a vendor. It is what happened on my clusters.
        </p>
        <h2>Reuse</h2>
        <p>
          Posts are mine; code samples are yours to use. If a post also appears on
          LinkedIn or the Fabric Community blog, this copy is the original.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
